OL,3,AChina funding UK research and sending
OL,4,Ait to Beijing's spies, MI5 warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 academics linked to
OL,7,FBritish institutions have unwittingly
OL,8,Fassisted China's espionage operations
OL,9,Fagainst the UK via a front company
OL,10,Fworking for its intelligence and
OL,11,Fsecurity services, MI5 has warned.
OL,13,FIn the highly unusual public alert, the
OL,14,FUK's internal security service warned
OL,15,Funiversities and academics that
OL,16,Fcontinuing ties with China General
OL,17,FTechnology Research Institute (CGTRI)
OL,18,Fcould ultimately lead to criminal
OL,19,Fcharges for aiding a foreign state.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
