OL,3,AChina funding UK research and sending
OL,4,Ait to Beijing's spies, MI5 warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity minister Dan Jarvis said MI5's
OL,7,Fwarning exposed attempts by Chinese
OL,8,Fintelligence agencies to use British
OL,9,Facademic research to undermine UK
OL,10,Fnational security.
OL,12,FHe said he had now written to all
OL,13,Funiversity vice-chancellors to end
OL,14,Frelationships with the organisation.
